# Node Modules
node_modules/
/.vs
CLAUDE.md
.cursor/
.claude/
CONTEXT.md
CONTEXT-MAP.md

# docs/ is the GMMC-Docs repository. Only these four paths belong to this module;
# module.json points its readme, changelog and media URLs at them.
/docs/*
!/docs/README.md
!/docs/CHANGELOG.md
!/docs/DEV_TODO.md
!/docs/img/

# Compiled LevelDB packs - built from src/packs via `npm run pack`; source of truth is the yml.
# Anchored: an unanchored `packs/` also swallows src/packs, hiding new pack sources from git.
/packs/